    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "Sun4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I usually stay inside, but I do go to the beach now and then.#$b#Pretty much only when it's raining, though.#$e#For some reason, staring off into the bleak horizon makes me feel... I dunno. Like it's worthwhile to keep pushing on, I guess.",
      "translation": "Obvykle zůstávám doma, ale občas zajdu na pláž.#$b#Ovšem skoro jen když prší.#$e#Nevím proč, ale když hledím na ponurý obzor, mám pocit... nevím. Asi že má smysl jít dál.",
      "sourceSHA256": "563a0e329e26b16cdf6e2b2d5483acdf318456d238388832c95fa9d2d30b835b",
      "translationSHA256": "90251f98ce2fc9502357cac001eae988a7e4a17eb11db1d36ed3e9293a82d7b8",
      "reviewChecks": [
