    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "event_garage3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't worry, I'll make sure to show you the ropes before I let you do anything dangerous.$8^There's no need to worry... I'll make sure you're safe.$8",
      "translation": "Neboj se, nejdřív ti všechno ukážu, než tě nechám dělat něco nebezpečného.$8^Nemusíš se bát... Postarám se, aby se ti nic nestalo.$8",
      "sourceSHA256": "f43f349704dfa28ef74b55c962939ad80dbded016bed205415e7514156eaa8a5",
      "translationSHA256": "ce54dfa86971fae8ec28ac176b2786f44edddb111d71420cc83ae9f0387e7eb6",
      "reviewChecks": [
