    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "event_city4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ugh... You sound like my Mom.$a#$b#...*sigh*$s#$b#You're right, though. I'm addicted to these things, it's not good.$s",
      "translation": "Uf... Mluvíš jako máma.$a#$b#...*povzdechne si*$s#$b#Máš ale pravdu. Jsem na těch věcech závislý a není to dobré.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "8fc1bdcc89668c6f52d0780e374e1db464d4d76a54d125add3a501f05706c213",
      "translationSHA256": "4f8c5c429fb0f4ba4240696a40cc8fa578053a429517a5d418e720c2550dda2a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
