    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Sebastian",
      "key": "summer_Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm looking forward to the cold, damp season. Channeling my inner toad, I guess.$h",
      "translation": "Těším se na chladné, sychravé období. Asi nechávám promluvit svou vnitřní ropuchu.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "e7733954bc157f09b6b1d3b070ca6e03c93bba82baf463d7a8788583c3cd6cac",
